    "text": "Give the decreasing order of reactivity of the following compounds with HBr.<br />\r(I) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6930ebb7-5ea8-4c7c-9875-8e36502d9ab4.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.35in;height:0.55in\" /><br />\r<br />\r(II) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/e69762eb-8230-46cd-9685-a438965901f2.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.95833in;height:0.55in\" /><br />\r<br />\r(III) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/51fc5390-3b86-4fa6-8928-96494445192a.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.99167in;height:0.55in\" /><br />\r<br />\r(IV) <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/d6e057f9-0e09-4469-ad49-ba8796b031f0.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.80833in;height:0.775in\" />",
